BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:amorgos-tholaria-panigiri-of-agioi-anargyroi-tholaria-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270630
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270702
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agioi Anargyroi\, Tholaria
LOCATION:Tholaria\, Amorgos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Tholaria above Aegiali celebrates its parish saints on 30 June-1 July: great vespers on the eve\, liturgy and procession of the icons on the day\, and both evenings the whole village eats patatato (goat with potatoes) and xydato (sour meat soup) in the square and dances to violin and laouto. Vegetarian dishes replace the meat if the feast falls on a fasting day. Stay in Aegiali and walk or take the shuttle up.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/amorgos/#tholaria-panigiri-of-agioi-anargyroi-tholaria
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/amorgos/#tholaria-panigiri-of-agioi-anargyroi-tholaria
END:VEVENT
