LOCATION:Langada\, Amorgos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Langada above Aegiali celebrates 15 August at the church of Panagia Epanochoriani (Panochoriani) up the hill\; older pilgrims still ride donkeys up\, and afterwards the village serves patatato and xydato with plenty of rakomelo\, violins and dancing in the square through the night. The Archaia Arkesini association in Kato Meria holds a traditional food-and-dance evening the same day.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/amorgos/#langada-dormition-panigiri-of-panagia-epanochoriani-langada
